| Feature | Endpoint | Key details |
|---|---|---|
| **Filtering** | `GET /tasks` | Added optional `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` query params. All combinable, all optional. |
| **Pagination** | `GET /tasks` | Added `page` (default 1, ≥1) and `page_size` (default 20, ≥1). Returns the matching slice. |
| **Create task** | `POST /tasks` | Auth required. Validates `project_id` exists (404 if not). Auto-generates ID as `max(existing IDs) + 1`. Returns 201 with created task. |
| **Update task** | `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` | Auth required. Partial updates via `TaskUpdate` (only non-None fields). Returns updated task. 404 if task not found. |
| **Delete task** | `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` | Auth required. Returns 204 on success. 404 if task not found. |

### Verified test results

| Test | Result |
|---|---|
| `GET /tasks` (no filter) | ✅ 200 — returns all 4 tasks |
| `GET /tasks?status=todo` | ✅ 200 — returns 2 matching tasks |
| `GET /tasks?priority=5` | ✅ 200 — returns 1 task |
| `GET /tasks?assigned_to=alice` | ✅ 200 — returns 2 tasks |
| `GET /tasks?page=1&page_size=2` | ✅ 200 — returns first 2 tasks |
| `POST /tasks` (no API key) | ✅ 401 |
| `POST /tasks` (valid key) | ✅ 201 — created with auto-ID 5 |
| `POST /tasks` (invalid project) | ✅ 404 |
| `PUT /tasks/1` (partial update) | ✅ 200 — status changed to `in_progress` |
| `PUT /tasks/999` | ✅ 404 |
| `DELETE /tasks/2` | ✅ 204 |
| `DELETE /tasks/999` | ✅ 404 |
